      "widgets_values": [
        "Start game and Start audio are separate actions inside the webview. Loading this graph starts neither.\n\nChoose d1 for real local decisions, or Authored heuristic for a no-model comparison. Download d1 explicitly if missing.\n\nReset returns seed 7. Pause cancels pending decisions. Stop audio separately when finished.\n\nRaw shows the relative page URL; Rendered returns to the same running page. Reload restarts the demo.\n\nThis workflow needs both Genereti (webview) and GeneretiCore (arcade page/local inference). The text output is the page URL, not game telemetry."
